 "notes": [
  "Groups: 0 the square front's west 16 m (surface 58, w04-163 2024-09-18): the corner tower (a column of white-framed three-light windows to the top) beside the first balcony bays, the tower's top storeys over them; 1 the rest of the square front (surfaces 27, 57; w04-163 and w05-163 2024-09-18; groups 2 and 3 are its middle stretch, which 3DBAG cuts at 13.9 m (surfaces 1, 66, 82, 83) with the upper face set back behind the balconies (115, 64, 26), aligned to group 1's storey lines): four storeys of continuous balcony slabs with bar rails over a tall shop ground with a brick band, French windows between brick piers in a wide/two-light/one-light cadence; 4 the east front (surface 11, w01-73L 2024-11-21, behind autumn trees): punched windows whose cadence changes by storey (three-light pairs, singles), thin concrete ledges at the floor lines, tall shop ground.",
  "Colours: brick sampled sunlit on w04-163 and w05-163 (#85725a..#9a8067 in warm morning light) and set darker and cooler towards the overcast 2022 triage crop's purple-brown; slab edges and rails grey.",
  "Other walls (window grid): the west and north fronts (no panorama within 35 m; walls w02-253, w03-343, w06-343 have no crop at any date) and the courtyard."
 ]
